    fdn_title: "Top-Tier Capital & Liquidity Ecosystem Empowerment",
    fdn_subtitle: "Co-Building the New Infrastructure of Decentralized AI Computing",
    fdn_intro: "NEO AI Computing Matrix (www.neoneo.ink) is dedicated to building the next-generation distributed AI computing scheduling and value settlement network. Leveraging deep technical foundations and token economy design, NEO actively connects with top geek VCs, algorithmic market makers, deep-tech funds and public-chain ecosystem organizations, collaborating across decentralized AI R&D, network liquidity depth, cross-chain interconnection and global market expansion to drive the large-scale adoption of Web3 and AI computing.",
    fdn_logo_wall: "Ecosystem Partners & Institutions",
    fdn_visit: "Visit Website",
    fdn_synergy_title: "Synergy with NEO AI Computing Matrix",
    fdn_cyber_tag: "Evergreen Fund for Decentralized AI & Frontier Cryptography",
    fdn_cyber_intro: "cyber•Fund is a globally renowned geek VC focused on 'Cybernetic Economy', founded by Lido and P2P.org co-founders Konstantin Lomashuk and Vasiliy Shapovalov. Operating as an evergreen fund free from LP exit pressure, it backs decentralized AI (DeAI), distributed computing networks, Ethereum & Cosmos infrastructure, zero-knowledge proofs and cryptographic protocols, with early investments in Lido, Cosmos and Polkadot.",
    fdn_cyber_synergy: "Focusing on DeAI architecture evolution and computing network economy models, exploring trustless scheduling and value capture mechanisms for distributed computing nodes.",
    fdn_gsr_tag: "Global Top-Tier Digital Asset Market Maker & Capital Markets Partner",
    fdn_gsr_intro: "Founded in 2013, GSR is one of the longest-standing crypto market makers, with senior executives from Goldman Sachs and offices in Hong Kong, London, Europe and Dubai. It provides OTC, algorithmic market making and liquidity management, with investments favoring seed-to-Series-A DeFi protocols, Layer 1/2 chains, cross-chain bridges and institutional-grade instruments. GSR backing typically solves both exchange depth and liquidity.",
    fdn_gsr_synergy: "Providing professional financial infrastructure for NEO ecosystem assets' secondary-market liquidity, multi-platform market depth and global institutional capital access.",
    fdn_wintermute_tag: "Global Leading Algorithmic Trading & On-Chain Liquidity Provider",
    fdn_wintermute_intro: "Wintermute, founded in 2017 by Evgeny Gaevoy and headquartered in London, is one of the world's largest DEX and CEX market makers, renowned for high-frequency on-chain efficiency and serving as core liquidity provider for Uniswap, PancakeSwap and dYdX. Wintermute Ventures pragmatically backs trading infrastructure, derivatives protocols, liquidity aggregators and high-traffic consumer apps.",
    fdn_wintermute_synergy: "Boosting capital flow efficiency of NEO ecosystem tokens across DEX and CEX markets, building a low-slippage, deep-liquidity 24/7 trading experience.",
    fdn_runa_tag: "International DeepTech & AI Infrastructure Venture Capital",
    fdn_runa_intro: "Runa Capital was founded in 2010 in Moscow by renowned serial entrepreneur Serguei Beloussov (founder of Acronis), now headquartered in Luxembourg/Palo Alto. A veteran fund in software and frontier tech with hundreds of millions under management, it focuses on AI infrastructure, cloud computing, open-source software, quantum computing and Web3 protocols.",
    fdn_runa_synergy: "Leveraging its deep expertise in cloud scheduling, AI engineering and open-source ecosystems to support NEO's underlying technology evolution and global developer community expansion.",
    fdn_waves_tag: "Global Web3 Public-Chain Ecosystem & Decentralized Governance Organization",
    fdn_waves_intro: "Waves, founded in 2016 by Russian physicist-entrepreneur Sasha Ivanov, was once dubbed 'the Ethereum of Russia'. The Waves Association is the non-profit steward of its ecosystem, focusing on decentralized governance, R&D support and project incubation, mainly backing Waves-based and cross-chain projects through ecosystem grants and hackathons, favoring DeFi, NFT tools and community-driven DAOs.",
    fdn_waves_synergy: "Engaging in multi-chain interconnection, cross-chain asset bridging and global open-source developer community co-building to expand multi-chain scenarios for computing assets.",
    fdn_disclaimer: "Disclaimer: The organizations listed above represent ecosystem partners, liquidity infrastructure providers, and strategic technology collaborators within the broader Web3 and AI landscape.",
