    wp_ch6_s1_p5: "The three-layer structure interacts with each other, ensuring the ecosystem possesses self-regulation capabilities during expansion, stabilization, and adjustment periods. The overall token system follows the macro principles of \"controllable production, orderly circulation, continuous consumption, deflationary stability\".",
